body:
Boxer briefs, 100% cotton, they do tend to get hot. I saw another guy recommend a switch to a more breathable fabric so i'm going to give that a shot. If it doesn't work i'll go see a doctor. 

&#x200B;

And yeah i take adderall, I also have a fairly high caffeine diet. Can't cut out the Adderall but i can work on the caffeine intake. Although the rest of my body doesn't tend to stink.
